# Private Tuition Gift Packages

Ever thought of deepening your skills and knowledge in African Djembe or Dundun? Would you like to join the experienced drumming class? or perhaps this is the perfect gift idea for your loved one for Christmas? Join Rhythm Culture in some one on one training and get the most out of your drum, your classes and your experience with us.  Great gift ideas and an excellent way to get your friends/partner along to drumming! See below for some package deals.

-   1hr $50 (one person)
-   1hr $70 (two people)
-   30min $30 (one person)
-   5 x 1hr $220 (entry into experienced class)
